B.a6c=new A.Y(B.ft,["Owned by you","Beauty Memory","The preferences and care context Lumi\xe8re may use are visible, editable and yours to remove.","Nothing remembered","Lumi\xe8re will only remember context you confirm.","Your memory controls","Each memory shows its source. You can remove it without losing access to privacy or account controls.","Confirmed","Source","Confirmed by you","Shared by you","Illustrative result","Your routine","Forget this","Skin Profile","A clear view of your cosmetic goals, preferences and current care focus.","Build your Skin Profile","Share preferences or complete a supported experience to begin.","Goals","Preferences","Current focus","Your care","My Products","See what you use, what you saved and where each item fits.","No products saved","Save a recommendation or add what you already use when verified catalogue support is available.","Using","Saved","Paused","Do I Need This?","Product unavailable","Choose an item from My Products or a recommendation.","FICTIONAL DEMO ITEM","Product detail","A controlled demonstration of product reasoning and routine placement. It is not a live product listing.","Why it fits","This demo item illustrates a category fit based on confirmed beauty context. It makes no product-performance claim.","Where it fits","Remove from saved","Save product","No live price, availability, rating, retailer or affiliate relationship is shown.","Buy less. Choose well.","Lumi\xe8re checks your routine, saved items and current focus before suggesting another category.","You may already have this covered","An item you use already fills this category. Start there before adding another.","Consider the category, not a purchase","There may be a routine gap, but a live verified catalogue is not connected.","What this considered","Only your selected item, current routine and confirmed cosmetic context. No analysis score or commercial ranking.","Personal Thread","Progress detail","A calm timeline of supported results and the care choices around them.","Complete a supported experience to form an honest baseline.","Illustrative timeline state. No measured change.","Lumi\xe8re only shows measured change after comparable, validated evidence exists.","Photo storage","See whether Lumi\xe8re keeps any beauty photos and control future saving.","Persistent photo saving is off","This device demo does not upload or retain your photos. Temporary local previews are discarded.","Production photo storage remains unavailable until consent, retention, deletion and legal review are approved.","Continue with deeper personal guidance","Premium connects validated Precision, progress allowances and continuity. Free guidance and privacy controls remain available.","Validated Precision allowances","Comparable progress when scientifically supported","A dedicated Hair Precision journey","Continuity across Coach, routines and Beauty Memory","See plans","Continue free","Activate Premium","Purchase, pending, restore and management states are ready for an approved store connection.","Real purchases are disabled in this demo. No charge can be made.","Premium value","View product","A user-chosen care step; it is not a treatment or measured outcome.","Your product","Move earlier","Move later","Comfort-first skin care","You confirmed that a simple, comfort-led routine matters to you.","Hair softness preference","You shared that softness and manageability guide your care choices.","Natural nail finish","You prefer a restrained, natural-looking finish.","Demo moisture veil","Demo softness conditioner","Demo care oil","A calm, comfortable-looking finish","A short, simple routine","Fragrance-free options where verified","Skin baseline preview","Shows where a validated baseline could appear; this is not measured data.","Routine refined","A moisturizer step was placed in the morning routine.","Hair context added","A softness preference was added to the personal thread."],t.w)
B.a6a=new A.Y(B.ft,["Eid av deg","Beauty Memory","Preferansene og pleiekonteksten Lumi\xe8re kan bruke er synlige, redigerbare og dine \xe5 fjerne.","Ingenting er husket","Lumi\xe8re husker bare kontekst du bekrefter.","Dine minnekontroller","Hvert minne viser kilden. Du kan fjerne det uten \xe5 miste tilgang til personvern eller konto.","Bekreftet","Kilde","Bekreftet av deg","Delt av deg","Illustrativt resultat","Din rutine","Glem dette","Hudprofil","En tydelig oversikt over kosmetiske m\xe5l, preferanser og n\xe5v\xe6rende pleiefokus.","Bygg hudprofilen din","Del preferanser eller fullf\xf8r en st\xf8ttet opplevelse for \xe5 begynne.","M\xe5l","Preferanser","N\xe5v\xe6rende fokus","Din pleie","Mine produkter","Se hva du bruker, har lagret og hvor hvert produkt passer.","Ingen lagrede produkter","Lagre en anbefaling eller legg til det du bruker n\xe5r verifisert katalogst\xf8tte finnes.","I bruk","Lagret","Pauset","Trenger jeg dette?","Produktet er utilgjengelig","Velg et element fra Mine produkter eller en anbefaling.","FIKTIV DEMOVARE","Produktdetalj","En kontrollert demonstrasjon av produktbegrunnelse og rutineplassering. Ikke en live produktoppf\xf8ring.","Hvorfor det passer","Demovaren illustrerer kategoritilpasning fra bekreftet skj\xf8nnhetskontekst, uten ytelsesp\xe5stand.","Hvor det passer","Fjern fra lagret","Lagre produkt","Ingen live pris, tilgjengelighet, vurdering, forhandler eller partnerforhold vises.","Kj\xf8p mindre. Velg godt.","Lumi\xe8re sjekker rutinen, lagrede varer og fokus f\xf8r en ny kategori foresl\xe5s.","Dette kan allerede v\xe6re dekket","Et produkt du bruker dekker kategorien. Start der f\xf8r du legger til noe.","Vurder kategorien, ikke et kj\xf8p","Det kan v\xe6re et rutinegap, men ingen verifisert livekatalog er koblet til.","Dette ble vurdert","Kun valgt vare, rutine og bekreftet kosmetisk kontekst. Ingen poengsum eller kommersiell rangering.","Personlig tr\xe5d","Fremdriftsdetalj","En rolig tidslinje over st\xf8ttede resultater og pleievalgene rundt dem.","Fullf\xf8r en st\xf8ttet opplevelse for \xe5 danne en \xe6rlig baseline.","Illustrativ tidslinje. Ingen m\xe5lt endring.","Lumi\xe8re viser bare m\xe5lt endring n\xe5r sammenlignbar, validert dokumentasjon finnes.","Bildelagring","Se om Lumi\xe8re beholder skj\xf8nnhetsbilder og styr fremtidig lagring.","Permanent bildelagring er av","Denne demoen laster ikke opp eller beholder bilder. Midlertidige lokale forh\xe5ndsvisninger slettes.","Produksjonslagring er utilgjengelig til samtykke, oppbevaring, sletting og juridisk vurdering er godkjent.","Fortsett med dypere personlig veiledning","Premium kobler validert Precision, fremdriftskvoter og kontinuitet. Gratis veiledning og personvern forblir tilgjengelig.","Validerte Precision-kvoter","Sammenlignbar fremdrift n\xe5r vitenskapelig st\xf8ttet","En egen Hair Precision-reise","Kontinuitet i Coach, rutiner og Beauty Memory","Se planer","Fortsett gratis","Aktiver Premium","Kj\xf8p, venting, gjenoppretting og administrasjon er klargjort for godkjent butikktilkobling.","Ekte kj\xf8p er deaktivert i demoen. Ingen belastning kan skje.","Premium-verdi","Se produkt","Et pleiesteg du har valgt; det er ikke behandling eller et m\xe5lt resultat.","Ditt produkt","Flytt tidligere","Flytt senere","Komfort f\xf8rst for huden","Du bekreftet at en enkel, komfortstyrt rutine er viktig.","Preferanse for mykt h\xe5r","Du delte at mykhet og h\xe5ndterbarhet styrer pleievalgene.","Naturlig neglefinish","Du foretrekker en dempet, naturlig finish.","Demo fuktighetskrem","Demo mykgj\xf8rende balsam","Demo pleieolje","Et rolig og komfortabelt uttrykk","En kort, enkel rutine","Parfymefrie valg n\xe5r verifisert","Forh\xe5ndsvisning av hudbaseline","Viser hvor en validert baseline kan vises; dette er ikke m\xe5lte data.","Rutine justert","Et fuktighetssteg ble plassert i morgenrutinen.","H\xe5rkontekst lagt til","En mykhetspreferanse ble lagt til i den personlige tr\xe5den."],t.w)
B.a6f=new A.Y(B.ft,["In deiner Hand","Beauty Memory","Die verwendbaren Vorlieben und Pflegedaten sind sichtbar, bearbeitbar und l\xf6schbar.","Nichts gespeichert","Lumi\xe8re merkt sich nur best\xe4tigte Angaben.","Deine Speicherkontrolle","Jeder Eintrag zeigt seine Quelle und kann entfernt werden.","Best\xe4tigt","Quelle","Von dir best\xe4tigt","Von dir angegeben","Illustratives Ergebnis","Deine Routine","Vergessen","Hautprofil","Kosmetische Ziele, Vorlieben und aktueller Pflegefokus auf einen Blick.","Hautprofil erstellen","Teile Vorlieben oder schlie\xdfe ein unterst\xfctztes Erlebnis ab.","Ziele","Vorlieben","Aktueller Fokus","Deine Pflege","Meine Produkte","Was du nutzt, gespeichert hast und wo es passt.","Keine Produkte gespeichert","Speichere eine Empfehlung, sobald verifizierte Katalogdaten verf\xfcgbar sind.","In Verwendung","Gespeichert","Pausiert","Brauche ich das?","Produkt nicht verf\xfcgbar","W\xe4hle einen Eintrag aus Meine Produkte oder Empfehlungen.","FIKTIVER DEMOARTIKEL","Produktdetail","Kontrollierte Demo f\xfcr Begr\xfcndung und Routineplatzierung; kein Live-Angebot.","Warum es passt","Der Demoartikel zeigt eine Kategoriepassung aus best\xe4tigtem Beauty-Kontext, ohne Leistungsversprechen.","Wo es passt","Aus Gespeichert entfernen","Produkt speichern","Keine Live-Preise, Verf\xfcgbarkeit, Bewertungen, H\xe4ndler oder Partnerbeziehungen.","Weniger kaufen. Gut w\xe4hlen.","Lumi\xe8re pr\xfcft Routine, gespeicherte Artikel und Fokus vor einer neuen Kategorie.","Vielleicht bereits abgedeckt","Ein bereits verwendeter Artikel deckt diese Kategorie ab.","Kategorie erw\xe4gen, keinen Kauf","Es k\xf6nnte eine L\xfccke geben, aber kein verifizierter Live-Katalog ist verbunden.","Ber\xfccksichtigte Angaben","Nur gew\xe4hlter Artikel, Routine und best\xe4tigter kosmetischer Kontext.","Pers\xf6nlicher Verlauf","Fortschrittsdetails","Ruhiger Verlauf unterst\xfctzter Ergebnisse und Pflegeentscheidungen.","Schlie\xdfe ein unterst\xfctztes Erlebnis f\xfcr eine ehrliche Basis ab.","Illustrativer Verlauf. Keine gemessene \xc4nderung.","Gemessene \xc4nderungen erscheinen nur mit vergleichbaren validierten Daten.","Fotospeicherung","Pr\xfcfe und steuere, ob Beauty-Fotos gespeichert werden.","Dauerhafte Speicherung ist aus","Diese Demo l\xe4dt keine Fotos hoch und speichert sie nicht dauerhaft.","Produktionsspeicherung bleibt bis zur Freigabe von Einwilligung, Fristen, L\xf6schung und Recht aus.","Mit tieferer pers\xf6nlicher Begleitung fortfahren","Premium verbindet validierte Precision, Fortschritt und Kontinuit\xe4t. Kostenlose Orientierung und Datenschutz bleiben.","Validierte Precision-Kontingente","Vergleichbarer Fortschritt, wenn wissenschaftlich gest\xfctzt","Eigene Hair-Precision-Reise","Kontinuit\xe4t \xfcber Coach, Routinen und Beauty Memory","Pl\xe4ne ansehen","Kostenlos fortfahren","Premium aktivieren","Kauf-, Warte-, Wiederherstellungs- und Verwaltungszust\xe4nde sind f\xfcr eine genehmigte Store-Anbindung vorbereitet.","Echte K\xe4ufe sind in dieser Demo deaktiviert.","Premium-Wert","Produkt ansehen","Ein selbst gew\xe4hlter Pflegeschritt; keine Behandlung oder Messung.","Dein Produkt","Nach oben","Nach unten","Hautpflege mit Komfortfokus","Du hast eine einfache, komfortorientierte Routine best\xe4tigt.","Vorliebe f\xfcr weiches Haar","Weichheit und K\xe4mmbarkeit leiten deine Pflegewahl.","Nat\xfcrliches Nagelfinish","Du bevorzugst ein dezentes, nat\xfcrliches Finish.","Demo-Feuchtigkeitspflege","Demo-Conditioner","Demo-Pflege\xf6l","Ruhiges, angenehmes Erscheinungsbild","Kurze, einfache Routine","Parf\xfcmfreie Optionen, wenn verifiziert","Vorschau der Hautbasis","Zeigt eine m\xf6gliche validierte Basis; keine Messdaten.","Routine verfeinert","Ein Feuchtigkeitsschritt wurde morgens eingeordnet.","Haarkontext erg\xe4nzt","Eine Weichheitsvorliebe wurde erg\xe4nzt."],t.w)
B.a6b=new A.Y(B.ft,["Sous votre contr\xf4le","M\xe9moire Beaut\xe9","Les pr\xe9f\xe9rences utilis\xe9es par Lumi\xe8re sont visibles, modifiables et supprimables.","Aucun souvenir","Lumi\xe8re ne retient que ce que vous confirmez.","Vos contr\xf4les de m\xe9moire","Chaque souvenir indique sa source et peut \xeatre supprim\xe9.","Confirm\xe9","Source","Confirm\xe9 par vous","Partag\xe9 par vous","R\xe9sultat illustratif","Votre routine","Oublier","Profil Peau","Vos objectifs cosm\xe9tiques, pr\xe9f\xe9rences et priorit\xe9 de soin.","Cr\xe9er votre Profil Peau","Partagez vos pr\xe9f\xe9rences ou terminez une exp\xe9rience prise en charge.","Objectifs","Pr\xe9f\xe9rences","Priorit\xe9 actuelle","Vos soins","Mes produits","Ce que vous utilisez, enregistrez et sa place dans la routine.","Aucun produit enregistr\xe9","Enregistrez une recommandation quand un catalogue v\xe9rifi\xe9 sera disponible.","Utilis\xe9","Enregistr\xe9","En pause","En ai-je besoin ?","Produit indisponible","Choisissez un \xe9l\xe9ment dans Mes produits ou une recommandation.","ARTICLE DE D\xc9MO FICTIF","D\xe9tail du produit","D\xe9monstration contr\xf4l\xe9e du raisonnement et de la place dans la routine, sans fiche r\xe9elle.","Pourquoi il convient","Cet article de d\xe9monstration illustre une cat\xe9gorie selon un contexte beaut\xe9 confirm\xe9, sans promesse de performance.","Sa place","Retirer des favoris","Enregistrer","Aucun prix, stock, avis, distributeur ou partenariat r\xe9el.","Acheter moins. Bien choisir.","Lumi\xe8re v\xe9rifie votre routine, vos favoris et votre priorit\xe9 avant une nouvelle cat\xe9gorie.","Peut-\xeatre d\xe9j\xe0 couvert","Un produit utilis\xe9 couvre d\xe9j\xe0 cette cat\xe9gorie. Commencez par lui.","Consid\xe9rer la cat\xe9gorie, pas l\u2019achat","Une \xe9tape peut manquer, mais aucun catalogue r\xe9el v\xe9rifi\xe9 n\u2019est connect\xe9.","\xc9l\xe9ments consid\xe9r\xe9s","Seulement l\u2019article choisi, la routine et le contexte cosm\xe9tique confirm\xe9.","Fil personnel","D\xe9tail de progression","Une chronologie calme des r\xe9sultats pris en charge et des choix de soin.","Terminez une exp\xe9rience prise en charge pour \xe9tablir une base honn\xeate.","\xc9tat illustratif. Aucun changement mesur\xe9.","Un changement mesur\xe9 exige des preuves comparables et valid\xe9es.","Stockage des photos","V\xe9rifiez et contr\xf4lez la conservation des photos beaut\xe9.","Stockage permanent d\xe9sactiv\xe9","Cette d\xe9mo ne t\xe9l\xe9verse ni ne conserve vos photos.","Le stockage production reste indisponible avant validation du consentement, de la conservation, de l\u2019effacement et du cadre l\xe9gal.","Poursuivre avec un accompagnement plus personnel","Premium relie Precision valid\xe9e, progression et continuit\xe9. Les conseils gratuits et la confidentialit\xe9 restent disponibles.","Cr\xe9dits Precision valid\xe9s","Progression comparable si scientifiquement \xe9tay\xe9e","Un parcours Hair Precision d\xe9di\xe9","Continuit\xe9 entre Coach, routines et M\xe9moire Beaut\xe9","Voir les offres","Continuer gratuitement","Activer Premium","Achat, attente, restauration et gestion sont pr\xeats pour une connexion Store approuv\xe9e.","Les achats r\xe9els sont d\xe9sactiv\xe9s dans cette d\xe9mo.","Valeur Premium","Voir le produit","Une \xe9tape choisie par vous, sans traitement ni r\xe9sultat mesur\xe9.","Votre produit","D\xe9placer avant","D\xe9placer apr\xe8s","Soin peau ax\xe9 confort","Vous avez confirm\xe9 pr\xe9f\xe9rer une routine simple et confortable.","Pr\xe9f\xe9rence de douceur des cheveux","La douceur et la maniabilit\xe9 guident vos choix.","Fini naturel des ongles","Vous pr\xe9f\xe9rez un fini discret et naturel.","Voile hydratant d\xe9mo","Apr\xe8s-shampooing douceur d\xe9mo","Huile de soin d\xe9mo","Un aspect calme et confortable","Une routine courte et simple","Options sans parfum si v\xe9rifi\xe9es","Aper\xe7u de base peau","Montre o\xf9 appara\xeetrait une base valid\xe9e ; aucune mesure.","Routine affin\xe9e","Une \xe9tape hydratante a \xe9t\xe9 plac\xe9e le matin.","Contexte cheveux ajout\xe9","Une pr\xe9f\xe9rence de douceur a \xe9t\xe9 ajout\xe9e."],t.w)
B.a6d=new A.Y(B.ft,["Bajo tu control","Memoria de Belleza","Las preferencias que Lumi\xe8re puede usar son visibles, editables y eliminables.","Nada guardado","Lumi\xe8re solo recuerda lo que confirmas.","Controles de memoria","Cada recuerdo muestra su fuente y se puede eliminar.","Confirmado","Fuente","Confirmado por ti","Compartido por ti","Resultado ilustrativo","Tu rutina","Olvidar","Perfil de Piel","Tus objetivos cosm\xe9ticos, preferencias y enfoque de cuidado actual.","Crea tu Perfil de Piel","Comparte preferencias o completa una experiencia compatible.","Objetivos","Preferencias","Enfoque actual","Tu cuidado","Mis productos","Lo que usas, guardas y d\xf3nde encaja.","Sin productos guardados","Guarda una recomendaci\xf3n cuando exista un cat\xe1logo verificado.","En uso","Guardado","En pausa","\xbfLo necesito?","Producto no disponible","Elige un elemento de Mis productos o una recomendaci\xf3n.","ART\xcdCULO FICTICIO DE DEMO","Detalle del producto","Demostraci\xf3n controlada del razonamiento y la ubicaci\xf3n en la rutina; no es una ficha real.","Por qu\xe9 encaja","El art\xedculo de demo ilustra una categor\xeda basada en contexto de belleza confirmado, sin promesas de rendimiento.","D\xf3nde encaja","Quitar de guardados","Guardar producto","No se muestran precios, disponibilidad, valoraciones, tiendas ni afiliaciones reales.","Compra menos. Elige bien.","Lumi\xe8re revisa tu rutina, guardados y enfoque antes de sugerir otra categor\xeda.","Puede que ya est\xe9 cubierto","Un producto que usas ya cubre esta categor\xeda. Empieza por ah\xed.","Considera la categor\xeda, no una compra","Puede faltar un paso, pero no hay un cat\xe1logo real verificado conectado.","Qu\xe9 se tuvo en cuenta","Solo el art\xedculo elegido, la rutina y el contexto cosm\xe9tico confirmado.","Hilo personal","Detalle del progreso","Una cronolog\xeda serena de resultados compatibles y decisiones de cuidado.","Completa una experiencia compatible para crear una referencia honesta.","Estado ilustrativo. Sin cambio medido.","Solo se muestran cambios medidos con evidencia comparable y validada.","Almacenamiento de fotos","Comprueba y controla si Lumi\xe8re conserva fotos de belleza.","Guardado permanente desactivado","Esta demo no sube ni conserva tus fotos.","El almacenamiento de producci\xf3n seguir\xe1 inactivo hasta aprobar consentimiento, conservaci\xf3n, borrado y revisi\xf3n legal.","Contin\xfaa con orientaci\xf3n m\xe1s personal","Premium conecta Precision validada, progreso y continuidad. La gu\xeda gratuita y la privacidad siguen disponibles.","Cupos Precision validados","Progreso comparable cuando exista respaldo cient\xedfico","Un recorrido Hair Precision propio","Continuidad entre Coach, rutinas y Memoria de Belleza","Ver planes","Continuar gratis","Activar Premium","Compra, espera, restauraci\xf3n y gesti\xf3n est\xe1n preparados para una tienda aprobada.","Las compras reales est\xe1n desactivadas en esta demo.","Valor Premium","Ver producto","Un paso elegido por ti; no es un tratamiento ni un resultado medido.","Tu producto","Mover antes","Mover despu\xe9s","Cuidado de piel centrado en confort","Confirmaste que prefieres una rutina simple y c\xf3moda.","Preferencia de suavidad del cabello","La suavidad y manejabilidad gu\xedan tus decisiones.","Acabado natural de u\xf1as","Prefieres un acabado sutil y natural.","Velo hidratante demo","Acondicionador suavidad demo","Aceite de cuidado demo","Un aspecto sereno y confortable","Una rutina corta y sencilla","Opciones sin perfume cuando est\xe9n verificadas","Vista previa de referencia de piel","Muestra d\xf3nde aparecer\xeda una referencia validada; no son mediciones.","Rutina ajustada","Se coloc\xf3 un paso hidratante en la rutina de ma\xf1ana.","Contexto de cabello a\xf1adido","Se a\xf1adi\xf3 una preferencia de suavidad."],t.w)
